    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d371">

                <pb facs="0654" n="526" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg526"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 371.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Langston to Mr. Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Port-au-Prince, Hayti</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-06-16"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 16, 1885</date>.
                        (Received June 30.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 746.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to advise you that this
                    Government, on the 29th May last, paid in drafts on New York and Europe, duly
                    indorsed by the secretary of state of finances, the respective sums awarded to
                    American citizens by the Americo-Haytian mixed commission, as reported in my
                    dispatch No. 740, less 10 per cent, discount, as agreed, which sums aggregated
                    $5,130, and which have been apportioned and paid as follows: <table cols="2"
                        rows="5">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>Mr. C. W. Mossell</cell>
                            <cell role="num">$2,250</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Mr. E. V. Garrido</cell>
                            <cell role="num">765</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Messrs. Bertram Brothers</cell>
                            <cell role="num">990</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Mrs. Maria Hamilton</cell>
                            <cell role="num">495</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Mrs. Isabella Fournier</cell>
                            <cell role="num">630</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN MERCER LANGSTON.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
